Rule 163 (when m is 1D, y is 2D, and rowvar is False, y's first dimension must match m's length)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : bool} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ v_3 = false then shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_1, 0)
